{"text":"Yay! You got your exercise in, you thought you were coming to poetry reading but it's a workout. I know. Yay! I can see all of your beautiful faces. That is so much better. I love this. First, a huge thank you to Mocha, to Amanda, number one. When I say this has been years in the making, it has been years in the making, I was looking at her emails and I was like, wow. It's like 2017. I was like, I've gone through puberty now. I'm a college student. Wow, so much has changed. So it's super phenomenal to be back here and as you'll see in some of the poems I'm going to read, Mocha's had actually a really huge stamp, I think, in some of the poems I hold most dear in kind of the career that I've been lucky enough to have. So that's super special to be here as well. I'm going to read a few poems.","words":[{"text":"Yay","start":0.72,"end":1.16,"punct":"!"},{"text":"You","start":1.62,"end":1.92},{"text":"got","start":1.92,"end":2.04},{"text":"your","start":2.04,"end":2.18},{"text":"exercise","start":2.18,"end":2.72},{"text":"in","start":2.72,"end":3.22,"punct":","},{"text":"you","start":3.32,"end":3.36},{"text":"thought","start":3.36,"end":3.52},{"text":"you","start":3.52,"end":3.68},{"text":"were","start":3.68,"end":3.76},{"text":"coming","start":3.76,"end":3.96},{"text":"to","start":3.96,"end":4.22},{"text":"poetry","start":4.22,"end":4.64},{"text":"reading","start":4.64,"end":5.2},{"text":"but","start":5.2,"end":5.4},{"text":"it's","start":5.4,"end":5.58},{"text":"a","start":5.58,"end":5.68},{"text":"workout","start":5.68,"end":6.06,"punct":"."},{"text":"I","start":6.52,"end":6.56},{"text":"know","start":6.56,"end":6.96,"punct":"."},{"text":"Yay","start":8.38,"end":8.82,"punct":"!"},{"text":"I","start":8.92,"end":9.06},{"text":"can","start":9.06,"end":9.18},{"text":"see","start":9.18,"end":9.38},{"text":"all","start":9.38,"end":9.72},{"text":"of","start":9.72,"end":9.88},{"text":"your","start":9.88,"end":10.0},{"text":"beautiful","start":10.0,"end":10.64},{"text